==Battleground==
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Wise Swordsman (Enemy)|Wise Swordsman]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

